{"2350230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clayverse", "steam_appid": 2350230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADVENTURE AWAITS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clayverse is a sci-fi RPG for 1–4 players where defeated enemies become future allies. Explore bizarre alien planets, master tactical ability-based combat, gather clay, and rebuild your damaged spaceship as you search for a way home. Play solo with creature companions at your side, or assemble a crew of up to four players in online co-op.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REBUILD EUREKA</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/6e7673fd8809091dde3b8f7f1776a8eb.poster.avif?t=1787588045\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/6e7673fd8809091dde3b8f7f1776a8eb.webm?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/6e7673fd8809091dde3b8f7f1776a8eb.mp4?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, return to Eureka—your spaceship, home, research facility, and occasional source of questionable advice. Repair and upgrade its stations to unlock new crafting options, P.A.C.K.s, talents, equipment, customization, and access to increasingly dangerous regions of the anomaly. Every successful expedition helps bring Eureka back to life and takes you one step closer to home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLAY IS MORE THAN A CRAFTING MATERIAL</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/2ac6edf44c10417a2218b936b92b1058.poster.avif?t=1787588045\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/2ac6edf44c10417a2218b936b92b1058.webm?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/2ac6edf44c10417a2218b936b92b1058.mp4?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine deposits across alien worlds and return with different colors of clay. Each color is a valuable ingredient used to craft weapons and armor, awaken equipment traits, summon creatures, and restore Eureka’s damaged systems. Experiment with clay combinations to create gear that complements your P.A.C.K., your companion, and the way you want to play. What you bring home shapes what you become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE MULTIVERSE</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/1a8eea98dac1975f850fccf1251d2526.poster.avif?t=1787588045\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/1a8eea98dac1975f850fccf1251d2526.webm?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/1a8eea98dac1975f850fccf1251d2526.mp4?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a colorful multiverse where every inch of the landscape is sculpted entirely from clay. Every world filled with bizarre wildlife, dangerous bosses, hidden resources, and mysteries waiting to be uncovered. Clayverse mixes playful sci-fi adventure with dark comedy and satisfyingly squishy clay violence. Things may get gruesome—but fortunately, everyone is mostly recyclable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEAT IT. SCAN IT. SUMMON IT</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/a66cd9c0624ebbe18f4e77553d073373.poster.avif?t=1787588045\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/a66cd9c0624ebbe18f4e77553d073373.webm?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/a66cd9c0624ebbe18f4e77553d073373.mp4?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every alien you encounter is a potential new member of your party. Defeat strange creatures, scan what remains, and add their biological blueprint to your growing collection. Back aboard Eureka, use your discoveries to print an ally you can summon into battle. Build a roster for different situations, strengthen your favorite creatures, and bring the right companion for the mission ahead. Even when playing alone, you do not have to fight alone.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADVENTURE AWAITS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clayverse is a sci-fi RPG for 1–4 players where defeated enemies become future allies. Explore bizarre alien planets, master tactical ability-based combat, gather clay, and rebuild your damaged spaceship as you search for a way home. Play solo with creature companions at your side, or assemble a crew of up to four players in online co-op.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REBUILD EUREKA</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/6e7673fd8809091dde3b8f7f1776a8eb.poster.avif?t=1787588045\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/6e7673fd8809091dde3b8f7f1776a8eb.webm?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/6e7673fd8809091dde3b8f7f1776a8eb.mp4?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, return to Eureka—your spaceship, home, research facility, and occasional source of questionable advice. Repair and upgrade its stations to unlock new crafting options, P.A.C.K.s, talents, equipment, customization, and access to increasingly dangerous regions of the anomaly. Every successful expedition helps bring Eureka back to life and takes you one step closer to home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLAY IS MORE THAN A CRAFTING MATERIAL</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/2ac6edf44c10417a2218b936b92b1058.poster.avif?t=1787588045\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/2ac6edf44c10417a2218b936b92b1058.webm?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/2ac6edf44c10417a2218b936b92b1058.mp4?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine deposits across alien worlds and return with different colors of clay. Each color is a valuable ingredient used to craft weapons and armor, awaken equipment traits, summon creatures, and restore Eureka’s damaged systems. Experiment with clay combinations to create gear that complements your P.A.C.K., your companion, and the way you want to play. What you bring home shapes what you become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE MULTIVERSE</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/1a8eea98dac1975f850fccf1251d2526.poster.avif?t=1787588045\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/1a8eea98dac1975f850fccf1251d2526.webm?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/1a8eea98dac1975f850fccf1251d2526.mp4?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a colorful multiverse where every inch of the landscape is sculpted entirely from clay. Every world filled with bizarre wildlife, dangerous bosses, hidden resources, and mysteries waiting to be uncovered. Clayverse mixes playful sci-fi adventure with dark comedy and satisfyingly squishy clay violence. Things may get gruesome—but fortunately, everyone is mostly recyclable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEAT IT. SCAN IT. SUMMON IT</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/a66cd9c0624ebbe18f4e77553d073373.poster.avif?t=1787588045\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/a66cd9c0624ebbe18f4e77553d073373.webm?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/extras/a66cd9c0624ebbe18f4e77553d073373.mp4?t=1787588045\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every alien you encounter is a potential new member of your party. Defeat strange creatures, scan what remains, and add their biological blueprint to your growing collection. Back aboard Eureka, use your discoveries to print an ally you can summon into battle. Build a roster for different situations, strengthen your favorite creatures, and bring the right companion for the mission ahead. Even when playing alone, you do not have to fight alone.</p>", "short_description": "Embark on an epic quest in the extraordinary world of Clayverse. Mold your clay hero, master crafting, and explore a mesmerizing multiverse. Engage in tactical clay combat inspired by classic MMORPGs, and experience gory claymation for a thrilling, darkly humorous twist.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Italian, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/907dd260767729aa8272672cc800c441157593f9/header.jpg?t=1787588045", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/b20be4926a28dd4c24219eb6471d41d2040dcc3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787588045", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350230/b20be4926a28dd4c24219eb6471d41d2040dcc3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787588045", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Space Lizard Studio"], "publishers": ["Space Lizard Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 25, "description": "Steam Leaderboards"}, {"id": 62, "descri